<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδια-τρίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have intercourse with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προσδιατρίβοντές σοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					168a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Ἀλεξανδρείᾳ π. τινὰ χρόνον</span>
			<i>spend</i> some time <i>longer</i> in
				<i><span class="en">A., <u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				217.2</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				31.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. dat. rei,
				<i>occupy oneself with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλαβαῖς καὶ γράμμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidipp.
					28.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>spend further time on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς Ξενοφῶντος οἰκονομικοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.25
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκροάμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.725f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.135
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c. dat., <i>abide
			by</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κυήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.981f
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὸς ὄγκῳ -τρίβοντος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				934b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>stay yet longer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				481.13
			</span></i>.</div>
